1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,800
Evan joins Harborline’s partner ecosystem as a person from Tidewater Channel Systems.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:14,400
External ID signs Evan into the Integration Exchange and connects him to a verified partner relationship.

3
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:23,000
Evan registers an integration. Harborline then issues a separate application identity with explicit client credential scope.

4
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:31,700
The machine token can read the approved sandbox API, while an ungranted production action is denied at the API boundary.

5
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:39,500
Show both subjects: Evan sponsors the integration, but the API call runs as the application. That handoff is the proof.
